          <li>
            <a href="#escala" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-[9px] text-slate-600"></i>
              <span>Escala &amp; Métricas Duras ($690 MM)</span>
