            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#anclas" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-[9px] text-slate-600"></i>
              <span>Oro ($4.4k/oz) &amp; Magnetita (700M TM)</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#especiales" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-[9px] text-slate-600"></i>
